{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"taut-uncanny-koi","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n\nF21, F22A, and F22B are approved. Maintained Jira guidance claims a DIG fallback although project selection must be explicit. The obsolete onboarding reference was retained only until the maintained onboarding flow shipped. Both pressure-test probes default to a deleted ticket executable, substitute DIG, and use ambient Python.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Require explicit project selection with no default or fallback project.\n- Delete scripts/jira-onboarding-reference after confirming no inbound references.\n- Make both manual probes use the checkout virtual environment by default while preserving supported overrides.\n- Require a separate mutation opt-in for each probe and complete a nonmutating preflight before ticket, reconciler, or Jira mutation.\n- Keep connected probes outside CI.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Jira setup guidance names no default or fallback project.\n- [ ] Neither probe substitutes DIG or another project when JIRA_PROJECT is absent.\n- [ ] Probe defaults use the checkout virtual environment, and REBAR_ENGINE_DIR plus REBAR_TICKET_CLI overrides still work.\n- [ ] Each probe requires documented mutation opt-in and fails before mutation when project, credentials, executable, import capability, or opt-in is absent.\n- [ ] No repository reference remains to scripts/jira-onboarding-reference.\n- [ ] No CI workflow invokes the connected probes.\n- [ ] Focused preflight tests, bash syntax checks, shellcheck, lint, and type checking pass.","id":"c92d-2b20-273c-4f78","parent_id":"2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5","priority":2,"tags":["documentation","jira","F21","F22"],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Require explicit Jira project selection and repair reference probes"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787589880488830001,"uuid":"0a065656-e06b-4afd-9209-9fd236a107a8"}